@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

title user_account.status
[*] --> PENDING_VERIFICATION : customer or partner registers
[*] --> INVITED : staff or platform manager invited
PENDING_VERIFICATION --> ACTIVE : enters the correct email code
INVITED --> ACTIVE : accepts the invitation and sets a password
ACTIVE --> DEACTIVATED : partner deactivates a staff account
DEACTIVATED --> ACTIVE : partner reactivates the staff account
ACTIVE -[dashed]-> SUSPENDED : admin suspends the account (planned)
SUSPENDED -[dashed]-> ACTIVE : admin lifts the suspension (planned)
ACTIVE -[dashed]-> DELETED : account deleted (planned)
legend bottom
The 15-minute lock after 5 wrong passwords is not a status: the account stays ACTIVE.
Dashed arrow: planned, not implemented yet.
endlegend
@enduml